  "description": "Blake, who was on a winning streak as an American football player on a prestigious team made up of Alphas, has a secret. \n\nFirst, he’s actually an Omega. Second, he’s addicted to phenotype-altering drugs. Third, he’s a fan of the band Blue Hour, which he’s loved since high school. Now, with both his athletic career and marriage in shambles due to his phenotype, he discovers that a member of the band, his only solace in his bleak daily life, has moved in next door. \n\n *“I’ve watched every single game you’ve played so far.”*\n\nCould that member possibly be Derek Walker, the nerd he used to bully back in high school?!\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
